          shortDescription: "A 19th-century American domino trick-taking game adapted from Sixty-Six. Two players duel with tiles, winning tricks for points. The double-blank — 'Bingo' — is the unconquerable trump. Collect 70 points, claim victory, and score game points. Once hailed as the most skilful domino game ever devised.",
