          human: 'Your tiles: [6|6] (12 pts!), [5|3], [0|4] (trump!), [2|1], [6|2], [3|3] (6 pts), [0|0] (BINGO — the ultimate trump!). Your opponent leads [5|5] (10 pts). You can follow with [5|3], but you lose the 10 points. Or play Bingo [0|0] to capture it — but is it worth burning your best tile this early?',
          ai: "Game: Bingo (Dominoes). 28 tiles (double-6). 2 players. Trick-taking. Blanks are trump; double-blank (Bingo) is highest. Tile point values: doubles worth pip total, others 0 or pip of non-blank end. Win 70+ points in tricks, then claim. Game points: 1/2/3 based on loser's score. Match to 7 game points.",
